  ;; ── The five creative -ka ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  ;;
  ;; These carry no operating roles. Their roles ARE their works: one
  ;; steward per 作品, because a manga title and the title beside it share a
  ;; pipeline but not an audience, a release cadence or a reason to exist.
  ;; A single "mangaka engineer" would have to hold five unrelated editorial
  ;; states at once, which is the thing this fleet keeps saying it will not
  ;; do (`Act only inside this business` in the projected responsibilities).
  ;;
  ;; The role KIND is the work slug, so the fleet-wide key stays
  ;; `<business>/<kind>` and no registry code changes. Each steward is
  ;; authored under yakuwari/ rather than generated, because
  ;; `workforce.edn` templates are keyed by operating role and a work has
  ;; no template to fill it from — see `complete-roles`, which skips a
  ;; declared kind with no template rather than inventing one.
  ;;
  ;; Adding a work is one keyword here plus one authored map under
  ;; yakuwari/. Retiring one is the same edit reversed; the bot goes with it.

  {:business/id :mangaka
   :business/name "mangaka"
   :business/repo "cloud-itonami/mangaka"
   :business/domain "mangaka.itonami.cloud"
   :business/what "漫画家 — AI が描いた manga を公開し(reader)、公開済みのページを下絵に人が原稿を組み直す(studio)。作品の原子はページ(空間軸)。"
   :business/roles [:work-yamainu :work-zankyo :work-halfgram :work-ghostmass :work-ghost-hacker]
   :business/roles-absent
   [{:role :director
     :why "The catalog has no roadmap above the works — what mangaka does next IS what its five titles do next. Add a director if the studio starts making decisions no single title owns."}
    {:role :engineer
     :why "The pipeline (reader, studio, comfy) is shared infrastructure a per-title steward must not fork. Engineering it belongs to cloud-itonami, which already carries the role."}
    {:role :qa
     :why "A page either reads or it does not, and the steward of that title is the only party who knows which. A separate QA would have to re-derive five editorial contexts to say anything."}]
   :business/note "5 titles / 36 installments live at mangaka.itonami.cloud as of 2026-08-19: 山犬と硯(yamainu-1..12) 残響のカルテット(zankyo-1..9) 0.5グラムの宇宙(halfgram-1..8) 幽霊の質量(ghostmass-1..5) Ghost Hacker(gh-arc0-*). The role kind is the published slug stem, so a reviewer can go from a bot name to a URL without a mapping table. The steward is per TITLE, not per installment — otherwise the bot count tracks chapter count and grows without a decision."}

